<title>UK: OKB sets $500 million 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>OKB sets $500 million 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OESTERREICHISCHE KONTROLLBANK</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  REPUBLIC OF AUSTRIA</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    11.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE   L10.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+23 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED BEFORE 1100 GMT TODAY</p>
<p>		L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   OKB STD</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC   1.675</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 10-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
